<section class="utility-head">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">FAQs</div>
    <h1 class="h1">Answers for Your Wedding Journey</h1>
    <p class="lead">Planning a wedding should feel clear, not confusing. Here is how eJuno works today — from venues and vendors to registry and checkout.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="utility-panel ejuno-faq">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-q__text">How does eJuno help couples today?</span>
          <span class="faq-q__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a" hidden>
          <div class="faq-a__inner">
            <p>eJuno brings venue discovery, wedding services, planning tools, inspiration, and a venue and services registry into one calm experience.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-q__text">Can I book or enquire through eJuno?</span>
          <span class="faq-q__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a" hidden>
          <div class="faq-a__inner">
            <p>Where a listing supports it, product and venue pages connect you to enquiry or booking flows on eJuno.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-q__text">What is the eJuno registry?</span>
          <span class="faq-q__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a" hidden>
          <div class="faq-a__inner">
            <p>Your registry is a gift list of the venues and services you would love for your wedding. Add them from eJuno, share one link through your wedding website, and guests gift towards them through our secure checkout.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-q__text">How do payments, deposits, and refunds work?</span>
          <span class="faq-q__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a" hidden>
          <div class="faq-a__inner">
            <p>Shop orders follow standard checkout rules. Venue and service bookings may use deposits or staged payments depending on the vendor.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button type="button" class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-q__text">Does eJuno focus on destination weddings in Italy?</span>
          <span class="faq-q__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-a" hidden>
          <div class="faq-a__inner">
            <p>Content is Italy-forward today, with a design system built to scale to more regions over time.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-cta">
        <a class="btn primary" href="/pages/contact">Contact eJuno</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
